# The feature-engineering / fe-kaggle task package lives here and IS committed (PROTOCOL.md,
# task.json, run.sh, overview.md); only the large datasets + generated output stay out of git.
# The package now lives under results/ (archived); keep both locations covered.
/prototyping_datasci_test/*.csv
/prototyping_datasci_test/out/
/prototyping_datasci_test/agent/
/prototyping_datasci_test/verifier/
/results/prototyping_datasci_test/*.csv
